{"abstract":"In this article we investigate how enterprise crowdsourcing can be used to change the innovation culture in a consultancy company by conducting an empirical investigation in a large engineering consultancy. The analysis shows that enterprise crowdsourcing has created a new and different awareness of innovation, empowered the employees, supported collaboration across different organizational units to a new extent thus contributing to small changes in the innovation culture of the organization.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Scupola, Ada","Nicolajsen, Hanne Westh"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-381873"],"event":{"end":"2014-08-13","place":"Commisso, T. H., Nørbjerg, J. & Pries-Heje, J., dk","start":"2014-08-10","title":"Scandinavian Conference on Information Systems","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Employee Empowerment","Enterprise crowdsourcing","Innovation culture","Organizational collaboration","consultancy company"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the impact of enterprise crowdsourcing on company innovation culture the case of an engineering consultancy","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84927657366","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-381873","identifier":[{"id":"84927657366","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-289595b7-a0a4-4014-a0ef-748df8b754fb"],"keyword":["consultancy company","employee empowerment","enterprise crowdsourcing","innovation culture","organizational collaboration"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-4-6-1F98BA53678476DF4123B2FB72965B6F"],"oai":{"class":"Block