{"abstract":"A new design ―project preparation‖ preparing for the group formation in problem based project work is proposed and investigated. The main problem is to overcome group formation based on existing relations. The hypothesis is that theme development and group formation are somewhat counterproductive. Following research based design methodology an experiment separating the two was initiated.This was to provide for more openness and creativity in contrast to a design in which existing relations seem predominant.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Nicolajsen, Hanne Westh","Juel Jacobsen, Alice","Riis, Marianne"],"cuid":["S02-091.67-008025"],"event":{"end":"2012-04-27","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2012-04-25","title":"Designs for Learning 2012","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Group formation","Moodle","Problem Based Learning","Project Preparation","Project work","Research Based Design","Theme Development"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"designing for informed group formation","src":["aau","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/79346633/DfL2012_Conference_Proceedings.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S02-091.67-008025","ids":["aau-a5ec90b7-4c7d-43fd-884a-a8dfa94bd39f","itu-67dc949a-642c-47a2-b40a-9d9ddccbab9d"],"keyword":["Group formation","Moodle","Problem-Based Learning","Project Preparation","Project theme development","Project work","Research based design","Theme Development"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-2-7F8D8F2A89B620CB7D6A3841E348295A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":