{"abstract":"We investigate how an idea competition tool act as catalyst to create a new innovation practice and innovation orientation in an engineering consultancy company. The idea competition is used internally in the organization to collect employee ideas for internal process improvements. The case study reveals that the idea competition tool act both as a catalyst to think differently about innovation and as tool to guide the implementation of the new innovation approach through well defined roles combining fun and serious business. The idea competition tool helps to overcome existing organizational barriers by creating a strategic business architecture encouraging employees to contribute with innovative ideas that the company may develop and implement for the good of the company. The findings indicate that more and different innovation orientations may co-exist in the same organization, complementing each other, such as balancing an external customer orientation with an innovation orientation focusing on internal innovations.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Nicolajsen, Hanne Westh","Scupola, Ada"],"cuid":["S03-100.00-002974"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"keyword":["Case study","Idea competition","Innovation culture","Service innovation","engineering consultancy","innovation practice"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"creating a new innovation practice and a different innovation orientation through implementation of an idea competition tool","src":["aau","itu","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://sprouts.aisnet.org/12-26","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-100.00-002974","ids":["aau-3c905e2c-7d50-4324-afa6-b603c7c5bba3","itu-599a2897-1e65-4059-8beb-f7b8c2997f9f","ruc-2f3d6d53-948b-4c45-8fe7-2ece921ff8d0"],"keyword":["Idea competition","case study","engineering consultancy","innovation culture","innovation practice","service innovation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-3-E499706411E0E02EBA964359DA2B0623"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://sprouts.aisnet.org/12-26","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Communication and Information Studies (CIS)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, E-learning lab"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, The Department of Communication, Business and Information Technologies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{