{"abstract":"The use of Web 2.0 in higher education provides for a number of different possibilities. In this paper we look into the use of Web 2.0 as a platform for social learning supplementing traditional teaching methods such as lectures and on place group work. The findings are astonishing revealing challenges such as the unknown genre of Web 2.0 for learning and changed behaviors with relevance for the identity creation and perception of others. The insight points to a number of issues of relevance when Web 2.0 is integrated in design for learning.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Nicolajsen, Hanne Westh"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-084550"],"event":{"end":"2011-09-19","place":"Turku, fi","start":"2011-09-16","title":"IRIS","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"web 000000000002 000000000000 for social learning in higher education","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/66538677/IRIS2011.full.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-084550","ids":["aau-76c93b48-831c-4d03-a001-7a93c0233e9d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-44F64D1572AF313DBF884E6C97B9D4E7"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/66538677/IRIS2011.full.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, E-learning lab"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hanne Westh","key":"nicolajsenpau","last":"Nicolajsen","locid":"fc0c09b9-7317-48b6-9bdb-a09739397660","name":"Nicolajsen, Hanne Westh","orcid":"0000-0003-0355-7421","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Timo","key":"leinopedh","last":"Leino","name":"Leino, Timo","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9789521226489"],"issue":"15","pages":"543-558","series":"TUCS Lecture Notes","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of IRIS 2011"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-76c93b48-831c-4d03-a001-7a93c0233e9d"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Web 2.0 for social learning in higher education","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-084550","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"The concept of e-services has gained increasing use during the past decade. There is, however, no general agreement as to the precise meaning and scope of the term. The research purpose of the present chapter is, therefore, to discuss the e-service concept, its strengths and scope, and thereby contribute to the general understanding and definition of the term. More specifically, the chapter aims at examining one of the primary conditions for the development of e-services, namely the codification of knowledge in connection with knowledge intensive services. The e-service concept is used in relation to private as well as public e-services. The present chapter examines the e-service concept at a generic level and does not differentiate between private and public e-services.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Scupola, Ada","Henten, Anders","Nicolajsen, Hanne Westh"],"cuid":["S03-090.45-813419"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"level":"sci","mra":["hum","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"e services and the codification of informational services","src":["aau","itu","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.4018/978-1-60960-607-7.ch002","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-090.45-813419","identifier":[{"id":"105012810283","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-9db96e07-e1e0-4c2b-96cb-6d2509f66b66","itu-ae7de2f3-f5fa-454a-a1c6-43995e1345b2","ruc-ce1e37bb-9382-48cf-a26e-1f23b7059c23"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-150650DA3256F4299AE7CEA3990B6660"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https:/